    "## News\n",
    "\n",
    "The LSEG Data Model is comprised of many platforms, but here we focuss on the LSEG Data Platform. To access this platform, we use the LSEG Data Library (LD Lib.) for Python:\n",
    "\n",
    "<img src="https://developers.lseg.com/content/dam/devportal/api-families/lseg-data-platform/DataModel.PNG">\n",
    "\n",
    "We spoke at length about the LSEG Data Model. Let's not repeat ourselves, and instead forcuss on the task at hand: News.\n",
    "\n",
    "## Install & Import Libraries\n",
    "\n",
    "To install libraries in python, you can find the command in PyPl, in this instance, it is:"
   ]
